# 十三、Meta Description 的规则

这是我建议 Cline 严格执行的规则。

## 长度

目标：

> **140–165 characters**

但不是死规则。

核心是：

```text
[What]
+
[For whom / application]
+
[Technical differentiator]
+
[Commercial action]
```

例如：

> Custom machine knives manufactured from your drawing, CAD file or worn sample. Specify geometry, material, hardness and tolerance for your application.

这个比：

> We are a professional manufacturer of high-quality industrial blades with many years of experience...

强很多。

---

# 十四、Meta Description 禁止使用的废话

Cline 不得自动生成：

```text
high quality
best quality
professional manufacturer
leading manufacturer
trusted supplier
competitive price
one-stop solution
world-class
premium quality
best service
years of experience
```

除非后面有**具体证据**。

Google 对自动生成内容的核心要求仍然是准确、相关、有实际价值；AI 生成的 metadata 同样需要人工核实。([Google for Developers][2])

---

# 十五、CTR 的真正提升方法

不要依靠：

> Best / Premium / Top / #1

而采用 **Technical Specificity + Commercial Specificity**。

例如：

### 普通

> Industrial Blades Manufacturer

### 好

> Custom Industrial Blades | Made to Drawing

### 更好

> Custom Industrial Blades | Made to Drawing & Sample

因为第二个直接回答采购人员的问题：

> Can you make mine?

---

# 十六、Title 的 CTR 公式

Cline 可以使用：

```text
[Exact Entity] + [Differentiator] + [Commercial Signal]
```

例如：

```text
Custom Industrial Blades | Made to Drawing
```

```text
Circular Slitter Blades | Precision Ground to Spec
```

```text
Granulator Knives | M2 HSS & Custom Rotor Blades
```

```text
Shear Blades | Guillotine & Swing-Beam Cutting
```

而不是：

```text
High Quality Industrial Blades Manufacturer Supplier
```

